OL,3,GNEWSANew underpass created as #30m road
OL,4,Aopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #30m road has opened to support a
OL,7,Fcommunity "as it continues to grow"
OL,8,Fwith thousands of new homes.
OL,10,FWichel Way, officially known as the
OL,11,FWichelstowe Southern Access road,
OL,12,Fopened on Monday in Swindon, Wiltshire.
OL,13,FIt stretches from the Wichelstowe
OL,14,Fdevelopment and through a new underpass
OL,15,Fbeneath the M4 motorway to reach
OL,16,FJunction 16.
OL,18,FThe road was created to support the
OL,19,Flong-term growth of Wichelstowe, one of
OL,20,FSwindon's largest housing developments.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
