OL,3,GNEWSANew underpass created as #30m road
OL,4,Aopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Gardiner, from Swindon Borough
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "With thousands more
OL,8,Fhomes planned in the area, it is
OL,9,Fimportant we have the right transport
OL,10,Fconnections in place to support the
OL,11,Fcommunity as it continues to grow."
